{%- comment -%}
  Price formatting from the Figma file: "₹389.55". The store's own money format is
  "Rs. {{amount}}", so INR prices are rendered with the ₹ symbol; other currencies
  keep the store format. Accepts: amount (in cents)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if cart.currency.iso_code == 'INR' -%}
  ₹{{ amount | money_without_currency }}
{%- else -%}
  {{ amount | money }}
{%- endif -%}
